#: ../../src/guide/utilities.rst:2
msgid "Utilities"
msgstr "实用工具"

#: ../../src/guide/utilities.rst:4
msgid ""
"This chapter catalogues tools and techniques which are useful for common "
"tasks. The `libev man page`_ already covers some patterns which can be "
"adopted to libuv through simple API changes. It also covers parts of the "
"libuv API that don't require entire chapters dedicated to them."
msgstr "本章收录了对常见任务有用的工具与技巧。`libev man page`_ 已经涵盖了一些模式，只需对 API 稍作改动即可将其运用于 libuv。本章还会介绍 libuv API 中那些无需整章专门讲述的部分。"

#: ../../src/guide/utilities.rst:10
msgid "Timers"
msgstr "定时器"

#: ../../src/guide/utilities.rst:12
msgid ""
"Timers invoke the callback after a certain time has elapsed since the "
"timer was started. libuv timers can also be set to invoke at regular "
"intervals instead of just once."
msgstr "定时器会在启动后经过一定时间时调用回调。libuv 定时器还可以设置为按固定时间间隔调用，而不只是调用一次。"

#: ../../src/guide/utilities.rst:16
msgid ""
"Simple use is to init a watcher and start it with a ``timeout``, and "
"optional ``repeat``. Timers can be stopped at any time."
msgstr "最简单的用法是初始化一个监视器，并以 ``timeout`` 和可选的 ``repeat`` 启动它。定时器可以在任何时候停止。"

