#: ../../src/guide/utilities.rst:309
msgid "Loading libraries"
msgstr "加载库"

#: ../../src/guide/utilities.rst:311
msgid ""
"libuv provides a cross platform API to dynamically load `shared "
"libraries`_. This can be used to implement your own "
"plugin/extension/module system and is used by node.js to implement "
"``require()`` support for bindings. The usage is quite simple as long as "
"your library exports the right symbols. Be careful with sanity and "
"security checks when loading third party code, otherwise your program "
"will behave unpredictably. This example implements a very simple plugin "
"system which does nothing except print the name of the plugin."
msgstr "libuv 提供了一个跨平台 API，用于动态加载 `shared libraries`_。这可以用来实现你自己的插件/扩展/模块系统，node.js 就是用它来实现绑定的 ``require()`` 支持的。只要你的库导出了正确的符号，用法就相当简单。加载第三方代码时，要小心做好合理性与安全性检查，否则你的程序会出现不可预测的行为。本例实现了一个非常简单的插件系统，它除了打印插件的名字之外什么都不做。"

#: ../../src/guide/utilities.rst:319
msgid "Let us first look at the interface provided to plugin authors."
msgstr "我们先来看一看提供给插件作者的接口。"

#: ../../src/guide/utilities.rst:321
msgid "plugin/plugin.h"
msgstr "plugin/plugin.h"

#: ../../src/guide/utilities.rst:326
msgid ""
"You can similarly add more functions that plugin authors can use to do "
"useful things in your application [#]_. A sample plugin using this API "
"is:"
msgstr "同样地，你可以添加更多函数，供插件作者在你的应用程序中用来做有用的事情 [#]_。一个使用此 API 的示例插件如下："

#: ../../src/guide/utilities.rst:329
msgid "plugin/hello.c"
msgstr "plugin/hello.c"

#: ../../src/guide/utilities.rst:334
msgid ""
"Our interface defines that all plugins should have an ``initialize`` "
"function which will be called by the application. This plugin is compiled"
" as a shared library and can be loaded by running our application::"
msgstr "我们的接口规定，所有插件都应有一个 ``initialize`` 函数，应用程序会调用它。这个插件被编译为共享库，可以通过运行我们的应用程序来加载："

#: ../../src/guide/utilities.rst:344
msgid ""
"The shared library filename will be different depending on platforms. On "
"Linux it is ``libhello.so``."
msgstr "共享库的文件名会因平台而异。在 Linux 上是 ``libhello.so``。"

#: ../../src/guide/utilities.rst:347
msgid ""
"This is done by using ``uv_dlopen`` to first load the shared library "
"``libhello.dylib``. Then we get access to the ``initialize`` function "
"using ``uv_dlsym`` and invoke it."
msgstr "这是先用 ``uv_dlopen`` 加载共享库 ``libhello.dylib`` 来完成的。然后我们获取 ``initialize`` 函数（借助 ``uv_dlsym``）并调用它。"

